        "module-alias conjuncts to defined zero-arity actions",
        f"{top}:{top_fairness_line} defines {top_fairness}, but references "
        f"WF_vars action {top_actions[0]} at line {top_fairness_line} whose "
        f"definition at line {top_action_line} aliases "
        "Interleaving!HiddenTopFairAction, but target "
        f"{top_target}:{top_target_line} uses module-alias boolean operand "
